From: Maxim Storetvedt <mstoretv@cern.ch>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:24:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] firmware: qcom: scm: Allow QSEECOM on the Samsung Galaxy
 Book4 Edge

Required for EFI variable access on this device

Signed-off-by: Maxim Storetvedt <mstoretv@cern.ch>
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index b1a821d3b1bc..041c3451776a 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2266,6 +2266,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,x1e80100-crd" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,x1e80100-qcp" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,x1p42100-crd" },
+	{ .compatible = "samsung,galaxy-book4-edge" },
 	{ }
 };
 
